00:10:13.410 --> 00:10:18.570
So if you get a return from these
servers you're okay, right. So your

00:10:18.570 --> 00:10:20.940
code is handed to redirect properly.

00:10:20.940 --> 00:10:25.530
that's not to say that you should not
change to HTTPS. these redirection

00:10:25.530 --> 00:10:27.930
