00:10:54.120 --> 00:11:01.140
So than any other URL that you would
normally have as going to www you can

00:11:01.140 --> 00:11:07.230
now go to https.ncbi and
test. If you're accessing E-utilities,

00:11:07.230 --> 00:11:15.930
right there is https://eutils-redirect, right.
So simply place that URL instead of

00:11:15.930 --> 00:11:20.550
